      "statusChangeID": "5fe05b9b16bfda6270535f60",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "This message needs a bit of clarity! What this means is that Steam has not verified your account.\nPlease contact [our Support team](https://help.vrchat.com/new) and they may be able to help get you sorted.\nSince this is not a bug, I am closing this issue.",
